/-!
# GL-valued coframe actualization of the synchronized gravity-tail path

The synchronized gravity-tail occurrence already generates one exact radial
coframe increment.  This module actualizes that same increment through the
matrix-exponential retraction based at the occurrence's own origin coframe.
It therefore keeps the origin value and first germ while making every emitted
coframe globally nondegenerate.  Gravity `II+` and reaction are recomputed
from the generated GL coframe; no target coframe or residual is accepted.
-/

